# go.ymotongpoo.com: vanity import paths for Go modules, plus their documentation.
# Generated by `go run .`; edit modules.go instead. Rules apply in order, the
# first match wins, and they take precedence over static assets: exact paths
# first, then the splats. Destinations never name an .html file, which the
# validator rejects as a loop. The module page is stored under /goimport,
# outside the /<module> pattern that rewrites every path of the module to it,
# so that /<module>/<subpackage>?go-get=1 answers with the same tags.
/pbt/guide                   /pbt/guide/                    301
/pbt/guide/ja                /pbt/guide/ja/                 301
/pbt/llms.txt                /guide/pbt/llms.txt            200
/pbt/llms-full.txt           /guide/pbt/llms-full.txt       200
/pbt                         /goimport/pbt/                 200
/pbt/guide/*                 /guide/pbt/:splat              200
/pbt/*                       /goimport/pbt/                 200
